  "read_scope": "Read the full proposed contract and all five fragments/eight cases, complete current Rows and sameJson/fieldPath owners, current relevant Form/Grid/List selection/write boundaries, exact legacy configured projection/Form/Grid shared-data/filter/sort/save callers and existing acceptance source. Hash checks below are metadata only, not test execution.",
  "accepted_contract": [
    "Rows owns detached immutable visited JSON, local RowId, explicit received checkpoints, ordered operations and synchronous committed delivery.",
    "Application conversion preserves needed inherited/hidden/class/Date/BigInt/cyclic-domain meaning with explicit string/null/business-ID fields; mutable rich domain objects remain application-owned.",
    "Own null/false/zero/nested values, literal/prototype-sensitive business keys and optional missing fields keep precise boundaries; UI safe nested paths remain a separate contract.",
    "Nested arrays currently use indexed reads including inherited present slots and ignore named/symbol extras; characterize this instead of inventing stricter behavior.",
    "Requested columns plus explicit captured/live extras use native application projection; business identifiers survive and RowSnapshot.id is not payload data.",
    "Selected/checked/view/change scopes use existing current RowId APIs; delete checkpoint versus last committed display is a deliberate application wire choice.",
    "Existing shared Rows subscriptions and component disposers replace wrapper identity/global singleton ownership without a second synchronization store."
  ],
  "implementation_constraints": [
    "No new Rows method, recursive JSON/schema type, DTO/projection utility package, deep merge, synchronization registry or generic data library.",
    "Do not ship the legacy app fragments as unused example helpers: execute the concrete recipe in the later connected acceptance fixture or actual application caller.",
    "A wire status column may be named rowStatus only when that business domain reserves it; use a separate operation key when business status/rowStatus fields already carry content.",
    "Preserve nullable versus omitted data deliberately; undefined is not a stored JSON clearing value. No demonstrated top-level partial-property-removal caller was found in inspected examples.",
    "Reuse existing unsupported-value/atomic-batch/checkpoint/ordered/subscriber tests instead of restating them."
  ],
